  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52527f0d86e1a624",
      "translationZh": "和许多动漫迷一样，在处理日语原声动漫时，传统机器翻译引擎（如 Google Translate 或基础版 DeepL）的表现总是让我感到沮丧：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c83b0c84a98b8d13",
      "translationZh": "它们把日语敬称、句末语气词（-tteba、-zo、-desu wa）以及角色的俚语翻译得面目全非。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "87b408a22ced7afb",
      "translationZh": "它们难以处理主语省略（代词脱落语法），逐行翻译时代词的译法前后不一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ad6dcb4e8810afc",
      "translationZh": "云端转录 API 经常在遇到背景音乐（OST）、响亮的音效和角色尖叫时出问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c0eb67ea5e6849c",
      "translationZh": "为了解决这些问题，我开发了 NihonSub——一个开源工具兼同步影音播放器，能将日语原声视频文件转换为结合上下文的双语字幕。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b9f328b6688a8569",
      "translationZh": "🛠️ 架构与处理流程：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d63b9a2e8a5108f",
      "translationZh": "音频提取与 VAD 分块：使用 ffmpeg 的静音检测功能，沿着自然的语音停顿动态切分对话话语，避免把词语从中间切断。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecbb8686697a6fa6",
      "translationZh": "语音转文本：使用运行在 Groq LPUs 上的 OpenAI Whisper Large-v3 转录日语音频，实现近乎即时的转录速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d58ec03615f1387",
      "translationZh": "基于上下文的 LLM 翻译：通过 Groq 或 OpenRouter 将转录文本输入 DeepSeek / LLaMA-3，并使用专门的提示词，强制要求体现动漫中的细腻语义、保留敬称、保持角色语气，同时输出印地语和英语译文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "213b2d0d2afae48b",
      "translationZh": "同步影院界面：自定义 WebVTT 生成器和视频播放器，支持双字幕、按时间戳拖动定位，以及完整的播放控制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a60e886205e3e2e1",
      "translationZh": "💡 为什么不直接依赖标准 NMT？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ba4d1a477d0ac00",
      "translationZh": "在根据上下文和语气判断谁在对谁说话方面，LLM 远胜于简单地按字典进行逐字查询。借助零成本的免费层级 API（Groq + OpenRouter 免费模型），整个流水线无需支付订阅费用即可运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42d9986acc7928a6",
      "translationZh": "看看上面的演示视频吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a67879a002f24695",
      "translationZh": "GitHub 仓库：https://github.com/Abhishantpadam/NihonSub",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9deae3c07007f389",
      "translationZh": "我很想听听你对这条流水线的看法、针对本地边缘模型的优化建议（例如运行 Whisper.cpp 或本地 Ollama 实例），以及任何反馈！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7eb4a7231aecafe",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Grand_Marionberry115 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
